WEBVTT

00:00:02.756 --> 00:00:05.058
Daffy: You keep telling me you've got lucky feet,

00:00:05.082 --> 00:00:07.115
so show me some money!

00:00:22.287 --> 00:00:23.447
‒ Bugs: Over to you, Daff.

00:00:24.443 --> 00:00:26.563
‒ Daffy: Quit hogging the glory, rabbit.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.670
Fine, ya big baby,

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:29.783
I'll letcha in.

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:32.610
‒ Bugs: You want little old me to go?

00:00:34.706 --> 00:00:35.706
Money!

00:00:37.457 --> 00:00:39.323
‒ Daffy: Out with the trash!

00:00:39.397 --> 00:00:40.161
‒ Tourist: OW!

00:00:40.323 --> 00:00:42.370
For this I left Topeka?

00:00:42.474 --> 00:00:43.123
OOH!

00:00:43.386 --> 00:00:45.098
I'm goin' back to Des Moines.

00:00:45.173 --> 00:00:46.800
‒ Bugs: *pant* *pant* *pant*

00:00:46.899 --> 00:00:49.452
Phew! What a workout!

00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:50.716
[Very dead Tourist:]
‒ D'OW!

00:00:50.839 --> 00:00:52.819
For this I left Topeka?